==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Wormadam}} in its {{form|Wormadam|Sandy Cloak}} form.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fates Collide|Wormadam|44}} from the {{TCG|Fates Collide}} expansion.
*'''Land Crush''' is an attack that first appeared as '''Fissure''' on {{TCG ID|Gym Heroes|Brock's Golem|20}} from the {{TCG|Gym Heroes}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shining Pearl}}.

